OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786542495
OL,3,CPartner says early release of pregnant
OL,4,Cmum's killer would 'mock justice
OL,5,Csystem'
OL,7,FThe partner of a pregnant woman killed
OL,8,Falongside their unborn child by a
OL,9,Fspeeding driver has told ITV News the
OL,10,Foffender should not be eligible for
OL,11,Fearly release from prison.
OL,13,FCalvin Buckley lost his partner,
OL,14,FFrankie Julia Hough, in a road crash
OL,15,Fon the M66 in Bury in May 2023.
OL,17,FMs Hough, who was 17 weeks pregnant,
OL,18,Fdied after being hit by a driver who
OL,19,Fwas filming himself speeding at
OL,20,F123mph. She had pulled over on the
OL,21,Fhard shoulder with a puncture.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786542495
OL,3,CPartner says early release of pregnant
OL,4,Cmum's killer would 'mock justice
OL,5,Csystem'
OL,7,F"It came at the expense of somebody
OL,8,Ftrying to get likes on social media;
OL,9,Fhe was just doing it for a bit of fun,
OL,10,Ffor a thrill," Mr Buckley said.
OL,12,FMs Hough's eldest son and nephew, who
OL,13,Fwere in the car, suffered serious
OL,14,Finjuries. Her youngest son was also in
OL,15,Fthe vehicle at the time of the crash.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786542495
OL,3,CPartner says early release of pregnant
OL,4,Cmum's killer would 'mock justice
OL,5,Csystem'
OL,7,FThe driver, Adil Iqbal, was originally
OL,8,Fjailed for 12 years for causing death
OL,9,Fby dangerous driving. But, following
OL,10,Fan appeal, the decision was reviewed,
OL,11,Fand three Court of Appeal judges
OL,12,Fincreased his sentence to 15 years
OL,13,Fafter deciding the original punishment
OL,14,Fhad been "unduly lenient".
OL,16,FIt was described in court by Lord
OL,17,FJustice Bean as: "The worst case of
OL,18,Fbad driving any of us can recall."
OL,26,@yD@ROUzD@bO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786542495
OL,3,CPartner says early release of pregnant
OL,4,Cmum's killer would 'mock justice
OL,5,Csystem'
OL,7,FBut in June, Mr Buckley received a
OL,8,Fletter informing him that Iqbal may be
OL,9,Freleased early.
OL,11,F"I was shocked, and then I was angry
OL,12,Fthat again, like I said, they're
OL,13,Fconsidering it and devastated by the
OL,14,Ffact that our justice could be taken
OL,15,Faway," he said. "It makes a mockery of
OL,16,Fthe justice system."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786542495
OL,3,CPartner says early release of pregnant
OL,4,Cmum's killer would 'mock justice
OL,5,Csystem'
OL,7,FAround 5,000 people are expected to be
OL,8,Freleased early under changes to the
OL,9,FSentencing Act, down from an initial
OL,10,Festimate of 6,000, after exemptions
OL,11,Fwere announced as part of an urgent
OL,12,Fgovernment review of the scheme.
OL,14,FThe measures, which are due to begin
OL,15,Fin October, are designed to tackle
OL,16,Fovercrowding in prisons.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786542495
OL,3,CPartner says early release of pregnant
OL,4,Cmum's killer would 'mock justice
OL,5,Csystem'
OL,7,FOffenders convicted of rape and child
OL,8,Fsex offences will be exempt from the
OL,9,Fearly release scheme, but driving
OL,10,Foffenders won't, which means Iqbal
OL,11,Fcould be eligible to serve 50% of his
OL,12,Fcurrent 15-year sentence.
OL,14,FThe Ministry of Justice has defended
OL,15,Fthe move, saying it will stop the risk
OL,16,Fof prisons "reaching capacity and
OL,17,Fcollapsing".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
