PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786542495
OL,3,CPartner says early release of pregnant
OL,4,Cmum's killer would 'mock justice
OL,5,Csystem'
OL,7,FIn a statement, it told ITV News: "We
OL,8,Fhave been clear that we wanted to go
OL,9,Ffurther and block more offenders from
OL,10,Fgetting out sooner into their
OL,11,Fsentence, but could not do so without
OL,12,Frisking prisons reaching capacity and
OL,13,Fcollapsing.
OL,15,F"If that happened, police could not
OL,16,Fmake arrests, courts could not remand
OL,17,Foffenders and there would be unchecked
OL,18,Fcriminality on our streets.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31808
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786542495
OL,3,CPartner says early release of pregnant
OL,4,Cmum's killer would 'mock justice
OL,5,Csystem'
OL,7,F"We are pulling every lever to protect
OL,8,Fthe public and cut crime ` building
OL,9,Fprison places at the fastest rate
OL,10,Fsince the Victorian era, launching the
OL,11,Fbiggest ever expansion of tagging to
OL,12,Ftoughen community punishment and
OL,13,Fincreasing support to victims, giving
OL,14,Fthem a say in the strict licence
OL,15,Fconditions of offenders."
OL,17,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,18,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,19,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,20,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,26,@wD@YO]
