OL,3,CPartner says early release of pregnant
OL,4,Cmum's killer would 'mock justice
OL,5,Csystem'
OL,7,FThere is now some hope that Ms Hough's
OL,8,Fkiller could remain behind bars after
OL,9,Fthe government appeared to respond to
OL,10,Fpublic pressure over the possibility
OL,11,Fof PC Andrew Harper's killers being
OL,12,Freleased early.
OL,14,FPC Harper's killers, Jessie Cole and
OL,15,FAlbert Bowers, were found guilty of
OL,16,Fmanslaughter over his death and
OL,17,Fsentenced to 13 years in prison in
OL,18,F2020.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31810
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786542495
OL,3,CPartner says early release of pregnant
OL,4,Cmum's killer would 'mock justice
OL,5,Csystem'
OL,7,FUnder the current plans, they remain
OL,8,Feligible for release in January,
OL,9,Fhalfway through their sentences.
OL,11,FNumber 10 had previously said it was
OL,12,F"not possible" to exempt "one or two
OL,13,Foffenders" convicted of manslaughter
OL,14,Ffrom the early release scheme.
OL,16,FBut on Monday evening, Burnham asked
OL,17,Fthe justice secretary to look at
OL,18,Foptions to keep PC Harper's killers in
OL,19,Fprison, and then on Tuesday he said he
OL,20,Fwas "increasingly confident" he would
OL,21,Fbe able to prevent their release.
OL,26,@tD@AOUtD@NO]tD@ZOUuD@JO]|D@EOU|D@\O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31811
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786542495
OL,3,CPartner says early release of pregnant
OL,4,Cmum's killer would 'mock justice
OL,5,Csystem'
OL,7,FMr Buckley welcomed the intervention
OL,8,Fover PC Harper's killers but urged the
OL,9,Fprime minister to "look at serious
OL,10,Fcases on a much wider scale".
OL,12,F"There are other serious cases where
OL,13,Fpeople have lost their lives or been
OL,14,Fleft with life-changing injuries, yet
OL,15,Fthese cases are being treated as part
OL,16,Fof one blanket category. He needs to
OL,17,Flook at all of them individually and
OL,18,Frecognise the severity of what has
OL,19,Fhappened," he said.
OL,26,@qD@SOUrD@\O]tD@AOU{D@JO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31812
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786542495
OL,3,CPartner says early release of pregnant
OL,4,Cmum's killer would 'mock justice
OL,5,Csystem'
OL,7,F"Dangerous drivers are often repeat
OL,8,Foffenders, and they can pose a very
OL,9,Freal and ongoing danger to the public.
OL,10,FThere may be a crisis in our prisons,
OL,11,Fbut what about the crisis in society
OL,12,Fwhen dangerous offenders are released
OL,13,Fearly and go on to put other lives at
OL,14,Frisk?
OL,26,@oD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31813
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786542495
OL,3,CPartner says early release of pregnant
OL,4,Cmum's killer would 'mock justice
OL,5,Csystem'
OL,7,F"Andy Burnham needs to look at the
OL,8,Fbigger picture. This cannot just be
OL,9,Fabout one category of offence ` it
OL,10,Fneeds to be about protecting the
OL,11,Fpublic and ensuring that serious
OL,12,Foffenders are properly held
OL,13,Faccountable."
OL,15,FMr Buckley will find out in September
OL,16,Fwhether Frankie's killer will be
OL,17,Freleased early.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@MO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31814
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786542495
OL,3,CPartner says early release of pregnant
OL,4,Cmum's killer would 'mock justice
OL,5,Csystem'
OL,7,FHe said: "I'm now looking at the
OL,8,Fprospect of him doing only 50% of his
OL,9,Fsentence, and when I worked that out
OL,10,Fit ended up doing less time than we
OL,11,Fhad originally appealed for in the
OL,12,Ffirst place, so I can't understand
OL,13,Fthat. He'll end up doing seven and a
OL,14,Fhalf years.
OL,16,F"It's yet another example of road
OL,17,Fsafety not being treated seriously in
OL,18,Fthis country."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
